Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(design): freeze tone mapping

R2 compared lobby, verafin and cfia at tier=high on desktop under ACES
Filmic and AgX (out/wp11/tonemap/). ACES keeps the dark between the pools
on the ink background; AgX lifts the mean luma of the 3D area by about half.
Frozen: render.toneMapping 'aces', exposure 1.0, light.spotIntensity 40 cd.
Decision record in ART_DIRECTION.md section 9.

WP: WP-11
